  {
   "id": 1,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "LIGHT & LOOK\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 2, CC 65 to 80\n   1 Key direction\n   2 Contrast\n   3 Color of the light\n   4 Lighting\n   5 Time of day\n   6 Softness\n   7 Rim light\n   8 Sources\n   9 Source in frame\n  10 Shaped light\n  11 Air\n  12 When the light changes\n  13 Brightness key\n  14 Render style\n  15 Ink line\n  16 Gloss\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 2, CC 81 to 96\n   1 Wetness\n   2 Light in skin\n   3 Something glows\n   4 Wear\n   5 Color saturation\n   6 Dominant color\n   7 Lighting\n   8 suite: Noir\n   9 suite: Golden hour\n  10 suite: Comic ink\n  11 suite: Wet night\n  12 suite: Clean product\n  13 suite: Neon night\n  14 suite: Candlelit\n  15 suite: Sitcom bright\n  16 suite: Interrogation\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 2, CC 97 to 104\n   1 pair: When the render goes toon, the ink line is heavy\n   2 pair: When a secret comes out, the face goes half lit\n   3 pair: After a loss, the color drains\n   4 pair: A flashback brings the faded look\n   5 pair: When danger rises, the shadows deepen\n   6 pair: A reunion warms the color\n   7 pairs: Weather and surface\n   8 pairs: Light follows feeling"
   },
   "pos": [
